# Git safety

- Use branch pattern `task/*` created by `vibeops task add`.
- Include the TASK id in commit messages, e.g. `feat(task-015): short title`.
- **No force-push** to shared branches (`main`, `master`).
- Do not merge or push unless the human runs `vibeops task done` or asks explicitly.
